three hundred forty-three billion fifty-nine million six hundred thirteen thousand six hundred fifty

70
00:07:17,415 --> 00:07:26,927
three hundred forty-three billion fifty-nine million six hundred thirteen thousand six hundred fifty times ninety-four, divided by twenty-five, equals.

71
00:07:27,087 --> 00:07:34,703
one trillion two hundred eighty-nine billion nine hundred four million one hundred forty-seven thousand three hundred twenty-four

72
00:07:36,703 --> 00:07:48,063
one trillion two hundred eighty-nine billion nine hundred four million one hundred forty-seven thousand three hundred twenty-four times ninety-eight, divided by twenty-six, equals.

73
00:07:48,223 --> 00:07:55,512
four trillion eight hundred sixty-one billion nine hundred forty-six million four hundred one thousand four hundred fifty-two

74
00:07:56,112 --> 00:08:05,861
We have reached the trillions. Our next calculation still begins with the last completed value. Multiply first, divide exactly, and listen for the new result.

75
00:08:07,861 --> 00:08:19,256
four trillion eight hundred sixty-one billion nine hundred forty-six million four hundred one thousand four hundred fifty-two times one hundred two, divided by twenty-seven, equals.

76
00:08:19,416 --> 00:08:27,061
eighteen trillion three hundred sixty-seven billion three hundred fifty-three million seventy-two thousand one hundred fifty-two

77
00:08:29,061 --> 00:08:40,391
eighteen trillion three hundred sixty-seven billion three hundred fifty-three million seventy-two thousand one hundred fifty-two times one hundred six, divided by twenty-eight, equals.

78
