two hundred sixty-three trillion seven hundred forty-seven billion nine hundred fifty-one million seven hundred fifty thousand three hundred sixty

81
00:09:11,881 --> 00:09:25,061
two hundred sixty-three trillion seven hundred forty-seven billion nine hundred fifty-one million seven hundred fifty thousand three hundred sixty times one hundred fourteen, divided by thirty, equals.

82
00:09:25,221 --> 00:09:33,465
one quadrillion two trillion two hundred forty-two billion two hundred sixteen million six hundred fifty-one thousand three hundred sixty-eight

83
00:09:35,465 --> 00:09:47,678
one quadrillion two trillion two hundred forty-two billion two hundred sixteen million six hundred fifty-one thousand three hundred sixty-eight times one hundred eighteen, divided by thirty-one, equals.

84
00:09:47,838 --> 00:09:56,448
three quadrillion eight hundred fourteen trillion nine hundred eighty-six billion five hundred two million ninety-two thousand three hundred four

85
00:09:57,048 --> 00:10:05,249
We finished C thirty. Our ribbon paths, the sums of smaller choices, and our multiplying and dividing all led to the same sequence.

86
00:10:05,849 --> 00:10:14,225
From one empty path to a very big number, every place had its own value. Thanks for counting Catalan numbers with me. See you next time!
